{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And the nakedness of your mother's sister.</b> Its reason I have already explained in \"You shall not uncover,\" and behold, one who uncovers nakedness [commits] a violation of his flesh." "<b>They shall bear their iniquity.</b> If the matter is with their consent, he did not mention a punishment for a father's sister, nor did he mention at all a punishment for two sisters. And the discerning will understand. Also the words of the tradition are true."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:23.830421667Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}